Module T2.2 – AI-Powered Differentiation Strategies

This sample differentiation matrix shows how AI tools can help educators meet diverse learning needs. Upload this file into the Module T2.2 simulator to see a demonstration AI response.

SAMPLE DIFFERENTIATION MATRIX:

Unit: Fractions and Decimals | Grade 4 | Duration: 2 weeks

Learner Profile | Content Modification | Process Adjustment | Product Options
Below grade level | Concrete manipulatives + AI visual aids | Smaller steps, AI-paced practice | Photo documentation of models
On grade level | Standard curriculum + AI examples | Partner work with AI feedback | Written explanation or video
Above grade level | AI-generated extension problems | Independent inquiry pathways | Teaching demonstration or project
ELL Students | AI-translated vocabulary support | Visual + language scaffolds | Bilingual presentation option
IEP Accommodations | AI-simplified text + audio | Extended time, reduced complexity | Alternate assessment formats

